title: "SynthID-Text Watermarking in Chinese-to-English Machine Translation: Paired Translations, Detection Scores, and Lexical Measures"
abstract: "Paired Chinese-to-English translations of 60 LCMC expository passages produced by Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct with SynthID-Text enabled and disabled, together with per-item detection scores, score gaps, and lexical measures."
